From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: metaX contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dahlia: validate detail URL origin and work path

The shared DAHLIA/FALENO URL parser previously accepted arbitrary hosts and
paths, then GetMovieInfoByURL could fetch the supplied URL after checking the
slug against the provider's own WordPress API. Validate HTTPS origin, port,
base path, and exact /works/<slug>/ shape before any lookup or fetch.

Based on metatube-community/metatube-sdk-go commit
c62584675c593816cc07e7b5b977d14c7eb505a3.

---
